<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <title>TunedGPT</title>
        {% include 'partials/_head.html.twig' %}
    </head>
    <body>
        <!-- Navbar -->
        {% include 'partials/_navbar.html.twig' %}
    
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="container justify-content-center">
            <div class="row text-center">
                <h1>TunedGPT</h1>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Details -->
        <div class="container my-5">
            <div class="row justify-content-center mb-2">
                <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                    <div class="row g-0">
                        <div class="col-12 col-lg-4">
                            <img src=" {{ asset('images/tunedgpt.png') }} " class="card-img-top" alt="noahhumbert.com">
                        </div>
                        <div class="card-body col-12 col-lg-8">
                            <h5 class="fs-2 mb-4 text-center">Project Description</h5>
                            <p class="fs-6">
                                I have finished rebuilding an app I wrote about 2 years ago now. The whole idea of this app was to have a custom UI of ChatGPT.
                                It went from an app that ran a Flask Python dev environment on a windows server box in AWS to a containerized Flask webapp that
                                implements best practice and SQL tables to manage data. I am very proud of this rebuild even though it isn't much of an app. The
                                idea behind it and it being available to use holds sentimental value to me.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Resources -->
        <div class="container mb-5">
            <div class="row">
                <p class="fs-1 text-center">Resources</p>
            </div>
            <div class="row justify-content-center">
                <div class="col-5 col-lg-2">
                    <a href="https://github.com/noahhumbert/tunedgpt"><img src=" {{ asset('images/github.png') }} " class="card-img-top" alt="github"></a>
                </div>
                <div class="col-5 col-lg-2">
                    <a href="https://chat.noahhumbert.com"><img src=" {{ asset('images/weblink.png') }} " class="card-img-top" alt="website"></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Javascript -->
        <script src="{{ asset('bootstrap/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js') }}"></script>
    </body>
</html>

